the `2609` table elements of the `230` representatives.

For each index the entry is `none` unless the element is a rotation, in which case it is
`some ⟨z, p, q, m, eps⟩` where

* `z` is a primitive kernel vector of `A - 1` (so `(A-1) z = 0`, `gcd z = 1`),
* `cross (row p (A-1)) (row q (A-1)) = m • z` with `m ≠ 0` (the kernel of the two rows `p`,`q`
  is then exactly `ℤ z`),
* `eps = ±1` and `eps • form A z` is positive semidefinite (checked by its principal minors).

The table and its check are generated by `scratch/sgsep/gen_axis.py`. -/

